@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@ default shown here.
 | `slot_minutes` | `20` | setting in the clinic file: length of every appointment, in minutes |
 | `buffer_minutes` | `5` | setting in the clinic file: gap left after every appointment; slots start every `slot_minutes` + `buffer_minutes` from opening time |
 | `cancellation_notice_hours` | `24` | setting in the clinic file: a booking cancelled with less than this many hours to go is recorded as `late_cancelled` |
+| `max_daily_bookings` | `2` | setting in the clinic file: most bookings one phone number may hold on one day, cancelled ones not counted; `Desk.book` and the CLI `book` command refuse more with "{patient} already has {limit} bookings on {day}" |
 | `no_show_fee` | `25.00` | setting in the clinic file: amount charged for each no-show |
 | `reminder_lead_hours` | `24` | setting in the clinic file: a booking's reminder is due this many hours before it starts |
 | `booking_horizon_days` | `60` | setting in the clinic file: how many days ahead bookings open |
